\&\fBEVP_PKEY\-X25519\fR\|(7),
\&\fBEVP_PKEY\-EC\fR\|(7),
\&\fBEVP_PKEY\-SM2\fR\|(7),
\&\fBprovider\-keymgmt\fR\|(7)
.SH HISTORY
.IX Header "HISTORY"
This functionality was added in OpenSSL 3.5.
.PP
Support for \fBcurveSM2MLKEM768\fR was added in OpenSSL 4.0.
